      {
        "id": "vddba5b081c7adb19",
        "type": "EMPLOYMENT",
        "title": "Lead and delivered end -to-end insurance integrations with top insurers",
        "org": "HDFC Ergo",
        "entry_text": "Lead and delivered end -to-end insurance integrations with top insurers - HDFC Ergo, ICICI Lombard, Max Bupa, HDFC Life, ICICI Prudential, Bajaj Allianz, Universal Sompo, and more. Used generic designs in the implementations, thus avoiding the use of any insurer-specific code. Tech stack: Java, Play",
        "source": {
